WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
We are going to estimate how many piano tuners work in a city of a million people.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Start with households. A million people at about two and a half to a household gives us four hundred thousand households.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:02:20.000
How often does a piano get tuned? Once a year is a fair guess for a piano someone plays.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Twenty thousand tunings needed, a thousand per tuner. That gives us about twenty tuners in the city.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:03:00.000
In the next lesson you will try one on your own.
